{
  "version": 1,
  "document": {
    "key": "omem:apps/server/src/review/main.ts",
    "title": "repo-review 服务启动入口",
    "summary": "在回环地址启动独立评审服务，依次同步仓库关系、恢复知识、更新代码投影，并以显式模型配置构建 API。",
    "category": "workflow",
    "sections": [
      {
        "key": "startup-sequence",
        "title": "同步与恢复顺序",
        "body": "入口从环境变量或当前目录确定仓库根目录，API 默认监听 5180 且固定绑定回环地址。创建独立评审存储后，启动流程先执行评审增量同步，再恢复仓库材料和知识文章，随后更新代码投影并汇总文章恢复状态；因此启动会恢复既有知识，但这段流程没有触发知识生成。[[c1]]"
      },
      {
        "key": "model-and-server",
        "title": "模型选择与服务装配",
        "body": "该入口明确只承载评审 API，不接入个人工作区服务。[[c2]] 代码理解模型采用显式可选配置，构建出的模型端口可以为空并记录为 `none`；应用装配接收仓库根目录、API 端口和默认 5181 的 Web 端口，完成后才在回环地址监听。[[c3]]"
      },
      {
        "key": "shutdown",
        "title": "退出与失败处理",
        "body": "收到中断或终止信号时，入口先异步关闭应用再退出进程；启动阶段若抛出错误，则关闭存储并继续抛出原错误，避免失败后遗留已打开的数据库连接。[[c4]]"
      }
    ],
    "citations": [
      {
        "key": "c1",
        "label": "评审启动同步链路",
        "reason": "支持仓库根目录、回环端口以及同步、知识恢复和代码投影的实际执行顺序。",
        "relation": "implements",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/src/review/main.ts",
          "startLine": 13,
          "endLine": 25
        },
        "quote": "const repoRoot = process.env.REVIEW_REPO_ROOT ?? process.cwd();\nconst port = Number(process.env.REVIEW_PORT || 5180);\nconst host = \"127.0.0.1\";\n\nconsole.log(\"repo-review: starting incremental sync...\");\nconst store = createReviewStore(repoRoot);\ncreateReviewKnowledgeRepository(store);\ntry {\n  const stats = await runRev"
      },
      {
        "key": "c2",
        "label": "独立评审入口边界",
        "reason": "直接支持评审入口不装配个人工作区服务的边界声明。",
        "relation": "supports",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/src/review/main.ts",
          "startLine": 5,
          "endLine": 6
        },
        "quote": "/** review entry point: run the incremental sync first, then serve the review\n * API on loopback. It never wires up the personal workspace services. */"
      },
      {
        "key": "c3",
        "label": "模型与应用配置",
        "reason": "支持模型为显式可选配置，以及 API、Web 端口传入应用构建器后开始监听。",
        "relation": "depends_on",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/src/review/main.ts",
          "startLine": 27,
          "endLine": 43
        },
        "quote": "  // Opt-in model: only REVIEW_CODE_MODEL_CONFIG is read; default is no model.\n  const codeUnderstandingModel = loadReviewCodeModelConfig();\n  const port_ = buildReviewCodeModel();\n  console.log(\n    \"repo-review: code understanding model =\",\n    port_ ? port_.transport : \"none\",\n  );\n\n  const { app } = await buildRevi"
      },
      {
        "key": "c4",
        "label": "服务关闭与异常清理",
        "reason": "支持信号关闭应用以及启动失败时关闭存储并重新抛错的行为。",
        "relation": "implements",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/src/review/main.ts",
          "startLine": 45,
          "endLine": 51
        },
        "quote": "  for (const signal of [\"SIGINT\", \"SIGTERM\"] as const)\n    process.on(signal, () => {\n      void app.close().then(() => process.exit(0));\n    });\n} catch (error) {\n  store.close();\n  throw error;"
      }
    ],
